#. うーん、なんかさぁ…
msgctxt "0001 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Oh man... Oh man...!"
msgstr ""

#. …何？
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What's up...?"
msgstr ""

#. テンション上がってきちゃった！
msgctxt "0003 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I'm gettin' totally fired up!"
msgstr ""

#. えっ！？　なんで！？
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What? How come!?"
msgstr ""

#. なんでもいいじゃん！
#. せっかくテンション上がったし、競争でもしようぜー！
msgctxt "0005 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"How come doesn't matter! Now that I'm revved up, I\n"
"need to get it out! Let's race!"
msgstr ""

#. い、いや…競争はいいよ…
#. どうせ勝てないし…
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I-I don't think that's a good idea. I wouldn't stand a\n"
"chance, anyway..."
msgstr ""

#. …そう？　じゃあ１人で走ってこようかな！！
msgctxt "0007 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Really? Well, I don't mind a solo run!"
msgstr ""

#. …って言うか、朝日奈さんて、
#. 本当にいつも元気だよね…
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "W-Well, hold on... You always seem so excited, Hina..."
msgstr ""

#. あー、なにそれ…
#. バカにしたでしょ…
msgctxt "0009 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Huh? Hey, are you makin' fun of me!?"
msgstr ""

#. ち、違うよ…感心してるんだよ…
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "N-No, I'm just impressed..."
msgstr ""

#. ホントかなぁ…
msgctxt "0011 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Really...?"
msgstr ""

#. たまに陰口叩くヤツがいるんだよね。
#. 朝日奈の元気は<CLT 3>“バカ元気”<CLT>だって。
msgctxt "0012 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"I used to know this one guy, he was always like,\n"
"\"Hina, you're like, a <CLT 3>super spaz<CLT>!\""
msgstr ""

#. …バカ元気？
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Super spaz...?"
msgstr ""

#. 私が冬でも短パンで過ごしてるのを見て、
#. そんな事言うヤツがいるらしいよ。
msgctxt "0014 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Yeah! Like, he'd see me wearing shorts in winter, and\n"
"he'd say stuff like that."
msgstr ""

#. 寒さに負けるのは、
#. そっちの元気が足りないせいなのにさぁ！
msgctxt "0015 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"But if you lose to the cold like that, it just means\n"
"you weren't dedicated enough!"
msgstr ""

#. でも、よく風邪引かないね？
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wow, you did stuff like that and didn't get sick?"
msgstr ""

#. 風邪引くなんて軟弱だよ！
#. むしろ、寒い時こそ薄着になんなきゃ！
msgctxt "0017 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Getting sick is for the weak! If you're really\n"
"dedicated, winter means even lighter clothes!"
msgstr ""

#. これも修行の一環だからね！！
msgctxt "0018 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "It's all part of your training!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>修行…ねぇ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Training, huh...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …さては、苗木って、
#. 風邪引きやすいタイプじゃない？
msgctxt "0020 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "So, like, are you the type who gets sick easy?"
msgstr ""

#. 実は…そうなんだよね…
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Actually...yeah."
msgstr ""

#. ほら、軟弱だ！　修行が足りないんだよ！
msgctxt "0022 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "See? You're soft! You need more training!"
msgstr ""

#. よし！　そんな苗木にオススメの健康法があるよ！
#. さっそく、明日から試してみるといいよ！
msgctxt "0023 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Okay! I've got the perfect remedy to keep someone like\n"
"you fit as a fiddle!"
msgstr ""

#. え？　どんな健康法…？
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? What kind of remedy...?"
msgstr ""

#. 私も毎朝やってるんだけどね…
msgctxt "0025 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Actually, I do this myself every morning!"
msgstr ""

#. 上半身裸になって、
#. 乾いたタオルで肌を直接こするんだよ！
msgctxt "0026 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"You just strip down to your waist, then take a dry\n"
"towel and start rubbing down your bare skin!"
msgstr ""

#. その名も…
msgctxt "0027 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I call it...!"
msgstr ""

#. その…名も…
msgctxt "0028 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I call it...uh..."
msgstr ""

#. あれ…なんだっけ…？
msgctxt "0029 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "What do I call it again?"
msgstr ""

#. 乾布摩擦
msgctxt "0030 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Towel treatment"
msgstr ""

#. 青竹踏み
msgctxt "0031 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Bamboo beatdown"
msgstr ""

#. 青竹踏み、だっけ？
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Bamboo beatdown, maybe?"
msgstr ""

#. ええ？　それは違うんじゃない？
#. だって竹使ってないし。
msgctxt "0033 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Huh? I don't remember saying anything about bamboo..."
msgstr ""

#. でも、青竹踏みも健康にいいんだよね！
#. 足の裏は大事だって聞くし！
msgctxt "0034 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Although, some people think that using bamboo to apply\n"
"pressure to the bottom of your feet is good for you!"
msgstr ""

#. でも、やっぱり私のオススメは
#. 乾いたタオルで肌を直接こする…
msgctxt "0035 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"That's just crazy, though. Now rubbing yourself down\n"
"with a towel? That's where it's at!"
msgstr ""

#. その名も…ええっと…
msgctxt "0036 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "And I call it...uhh..."
msgstr ""

#. ヨガ
msgctxt "0037 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yoga"
msgstr ""

#. ヨガ？
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Is that like...yoga?"
msgstr ""

#. うーん、そんな名前じゃなかったよ？
#. もっとね、漢字ばっかで難しいんだ。
msgctxt "0039 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Huh? No, nothing like that. That's too short, too\n"
"simple. I'm sure the name was way longer..."
msgstr ""

#. でも、ヨガって凄いんだよね！
msgctxt "0040 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "But yoga's pretty great, though!"
msgstr ""

#. 達人になると、体が伸びたり
#. 火を吐けたりするんでしょ？
msgctxt "0041 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"I heard if you become a master, you can breathe fire\n"
"and make your body all stretchy!"
msgstr ""

#. それは…ゲームとかアニメの世界だけだと思うよ…
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I think that's limited to, like...video games and\n"
"stuff."
msgstr ""

#. うううう～、思い出せなくて気持ち悪い！
#. 苗木、助けてー！
msgctxt "0043 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Gaaaah...! I'm gonna throw up if I can't remember what\n"
"it's called! Help me out, Makoto!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>上半身裸になって、
#. 乾いたタオルで肌を直接こする健康法…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A way to keep healthy by stripping down and rubbing a\n"
"towel across your skin...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それって、確か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Let's take a shot at this...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 乾布摩擦…だよね？
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Is it something like...towel treatment?"
msgstr ""

#. そう、それそれ！
msgctxt "0047 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Oh my god! Yeah, that's it!"
msgstr ""

#. マンションのベランダで、
#. 早朝の風を感じながらの<CLT 3>乾布摩擦<CLT>…
msgctxt "0048 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"I love going out on my apartment balcony, <CLT 3>stripping\n"
"down<CLT>, feeling the wind on my skin..."
msgstr ""

#. すっごく気持ちいいんだよ！
#. 私も毎朝やってたんだから！
msgctxt "0049 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"God, it feels so amazing! I never let a morning pass\n"
"without getting in a good rubdown!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>マンションのベランダで上半身裸に…って…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Wait, so you went out on your balcony, and...stripped\n"
"down?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それって…大丈夫なのか…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0051 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And you were okay with that?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. マジで試してみるといいよ！
#. 健康第一ってね！
msgctxt "0052 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"You should give it a try! If you haven't got your\n"
"health, you haven't got anything!"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木が風邪引いたりしたら、
#. 私、困っちゃうからさ。
msgctxt "0053 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I'd hate to see you catch cold or something..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>朝日奈葵の<CLT><CLT 3>通信簿<CLT><CLT 23>に、今の情報を追記致しました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0054 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Hina's <CLT><CLT 3>Report Card<CLT><CLT 23> has been updated based on your\n"
"experience with her.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>おめでとうございます。
#. <CLT><CLT 3>“スキルポイント”<CLT><CLT 23>が上がりました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0055 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Your maximum number of <CLT><CLT 3>Skill Points<CLT><CLT 23> has increased!\n"
"Hey, look at you go!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>朝日奈さんから健康法を紹介された後、
#. ボクは自分の部屋へと戻っていった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>After being introduced to a unique sickness prevention\n"
"method, I went back to my room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
